# embraOS release signing keys — Ed25519 public keys, SubjectPublicKeyInfo PEM.
#
# The OS trusts a release manifest only when it is signed by one of the keys in
# this file (baked into the rootfs at /usr/share/embra/update-signing.pub) or in
# the operator's drop-in /embra/state/update-signing.pub. Several PUBLIC KEY
# blocks are allowed: a new key goes in beside the old one release before the
# old one stops signing, so an instance on the previous release still verifies
# the next.
#
# No key is present yet: the updater refuses every manifest until one is.
# The private key is the release operator's, made once with
#   openssl genpkey -algorithm ed25519 -out update-signing.key
#   openssl pkey -in update-signing.key -pubout
# and never committed. scripts/release-update.sh signs with it.
